{"title":"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is equilateral with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e4e71e9c0786b12fb9b4b5c67364147ed6e402f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> such that both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699784c989c3db382520e6f92819e062d239f504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f450f6af9c000449bff7dc1801fdd77978f6e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{FG}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> are parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />. Furthermore, triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70422100db8de33f8e5e0ab5062c5bb6a5ac969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and trapezoids <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd662e635fd79eea74cb296a005ebba3a8b8b04c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DFGE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e04ae5998ceeb9284f13f1c85244d9f7ec17546f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FBCG$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> all have the same perimeter. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd84151050a3ca360d8e91940655ccc7e3b3ecb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE+FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2eb992c9eae1b2af8bec0d92f03bde1e1e8b647.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(180); pen dps = linewidth(0.7) + fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); real s=1/2,m=5/6,l=1; pair A=origin,B=(l,0),C=rotate(60)*l,D=(s,0),E=rotate(60)*s,F=m,G=rotate(60)*m; draw(A--B--C--cycle^^D--E^^F--G); dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^E^^F^^G); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,N); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,NW); [/asy]\" width=\"302\" height=\"265\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74b84e2ae84146cdef9a15de8ea37c5e18cc2142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\dfrac{3}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\dfrac{21}{13}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\dfrac{13}{8}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\dfrac{5}{3}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"386\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdc975a5b35343ca18565b3a7cce9827d332bbbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/532cd91c2b8e759b1113a49eb21e9287f9abc572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />. We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/06959451895c1e8fcd1701908a6ee8f3427f5225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE + FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />, which is nothing but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Based on the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70422100db8de33f8e5e0ab5062c5bb6a5ac969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/8/9f8e2832b6f8af9c1b0d0312f03976d64797816c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCFG$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> have the same perimeters, we can say the following:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f559c4aafb9198fc9168722894b7490f666f854a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = x + 2(y-x) + y = y + 2(1-y) + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"324\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying, we can find that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8814ab02b72fa2edf86fb1bcb31a6a0258fd86b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 3y-x = 3-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c847b80b94041590f5cabc90651e9a9328d0774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-y = 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f7971148a0c4aac03901275f7cd73d852c482c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3-3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>After substitution, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/3/203360bc8ba976b36389a075b3cc85808cca891a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-10x = 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bc239a45eb6fbc5d4b9e9f197307e8c2db1aaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Again substituting, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/a/14aeefc3d3435fc2484af58aa32401c9ce8683f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9f4c45075600fc423c342d499fedf81c763c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{21}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XQpQaomC2tA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XQpQaomC2tA</a>\n</p><p>~sugar_rush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A\">2013 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017024646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 277/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip